# --- Agent assets -------------------------------------------------------------
# Team-shared contract (versioned): skills, subagents, commands, guardrail rules
# and hooks. Everything else under `.claude/` is personal state and stays local.
# A bare `.claude` ignore cannot be re-opened by a negation, so the pattern
# targets children and each versioned directory gets an explicit re-include pair
# (the directory itself, then its contents).
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/**
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/commands/**
!.claude/rules/
!.claude/rules/**
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/**
!.claude/settings.json
.fatory
docs/*
!docs/screenshots/
!docs/DEEP_LINKS.md
!docs/MCP.md
!docs/PLUGIN_COMPATIBILITY.md
!docs/driver-integration.md
!docs/architecture/
!docs/architecture/**
!docs/PLUGINS.md
!docs/RELEASE_SIGNING.md
!docs/releases/
!docs/releases/**
!docs/SMOKE_TEST_CHECKLIST.md
!docs/UPGRADE_ROADMAP.md
!docs/STORE_OWNERSHIP.md
!docs/WORKSPACE_SYNC.md
